{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desktop Lux is a program for decoration and advanced customization of the appearance of the Windows operating system. Thanks to its unique capabilities, you can immerse yourself deeper into the world of your favorite game by customizing your operating system accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A partial list of Desktop Lux features includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stunning animations and effects;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Use any video files as your desktop background;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Replace your desktop wallpaper with your favorite webpage and watch it get updated in real-time without any action on your part;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Change your usual mouse pointer to interesting cursors from our collection, most of which are animated;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Automatic change of desktop background images and screen savers;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- High performance and low resource usage.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3442300?t=1741281406","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3442300?t=1741281406","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442300/50f6b323fc48d9760151b0d015a81e691d6587d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741281406","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442300/50f6b323fc48d9760151b0d015a81e691d6587d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741281406","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desktop Lux is a program for decoration and advanced customization of the appearance of the Windows operating system. Thanks to its unique capabilities, you can immerse yourself deeper into the world of your favorite game by customizing your operating system accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A partial list of Desktop Lux features includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stunning animations and effects;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Use any video files as your desktop background;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Replace your desktop wallpaper with your favorite webpage and watch it get updated in real-time without any action on your part;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Change your usual mouse pointer to interesting cursors from our collection, most of which are animated;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Automatic change of desktop background images and screen savers;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- High performance and low resource usage.</p>","developers":["Pothos"],"genres":[{"description":"Animation & Modeling","id":"51"},{"description":"Design & Illustration","id":"53"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442300/header.jpg?t=1741281406","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257107940,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107940/movie480.mp4?t=1741280804","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107940/movie_max.mp4?t=1741280804"},"name":"Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257107940/28c6effcc9fbd0b85d5b7081a9320b9fe1e107f2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741280804","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107940/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741280804","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107940/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741280804"}}],"name":"Desktop Lux","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 / 10 / 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"window